WEBVTT

00:00:01.732 --> 00:00:10.800
<i>GRENADIER</i>

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:20.542
<i>Carving my footsteps
in the amber colored road...</i>

00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:30.356
<i>... I've finally come this far.
I keep my eyes on the road ahead.</i>

00:00:30.628 --> 00:00:39.764
<i>Only time moves faster than me...</i>

00:00:40.171 --> 00:00:50.308
<i>... I look back, and
the road behind me shines blue.</i>

00:00:51.315 --> 00:00:57.276
<i>The flames of all the lives
I've encountered...</i>

00:00:57.488 --> 00:01:00.889
<i>I wish I could hold them in my arms</i>

00:01:01.058 --> 00:01:06.724
<i>So that we don't get swept away
by this great river...</i>

00:01:06.864 --> 00:01:10.391
<i>... I want our hearts to be one.</i>

00:01:10.568 --> 00:01:19.567
<i>We're all travelers, after all.</i>

00:01:47.238 --> 00:01:48.330
You...

00:01:48.606 --> 00:01:52.133
We have been waiting
for you, Rushuna Tendo.

00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:56.610
You have earned yourself the title
"Grenadier" as the topmost Senshi.

00:01:56.747 --> 00:01:59.147
<i>Grenadier</i>

00:02:02.286 --> 00:02:05.449
I am a Grenadier?

00:02:11.262 --> 00:02:15.028
<i>Episode 11
Showdown with Tenshi</i>

00:02:15.299 --> 00:02:19.030
I don't deserve a title like that.

00:02:19.403 --> 00:02:22.702
Oh, do you disagree?

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:23.772
Yes.

00:02:24.075 --> 00:02:27.044
The Blade Bard Senshi, Sanzo Souma...

00:02:27.211 --> 00:02:30.612
...the Gaifu-Senjyutsu Senshi,
Teppa Aizen...

00:02:30.715 --> 00:02:34.776
...and the Enchanting Snow Dance
Senshi, Fuuka Shirato...

00:02:35.152 --> 00:02:38.417
...Suiro, Shinnoshin Hakubi...

00:02:38.522 --> 00:02:41.491
You defeated four Juttensen.

00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:44.389
I just stripped their armor off them.

00:02:44.495 --> 00:02:45.393
No...

00:02:45.496 --> 00:02:49.796
The name of she who killed them has
spread through the imperial courts...

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:53.392
...and even beyond the
borders of our nation.

00:02:54.605 --> 00:02:56.707
That name is Rushuna Tendo.

00:02:56.707 --> 00:02:57.935
<i>Wait a second.
That name is Rushuna Tendo.</i>

00:02:58.042 --> 00:03:00.875
I haven't killed anyone.

00:03:01.178 --> 00:03:05.615
We know what you did.
There's no use trying to deny it.

00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:08.210
I'd like an audience with Tenshi.

00:03:08.319 --> 00:03:12.312
You are a Grenadier who killed these
Juttensen, Tenshi's personal guards.

00:03:12.456 --> 00:03:15.220
Do you think we will let
you near her so easily?

00:03:15.326 --> 00:03:17.624
I am not her enemy.

00:03:17.762 --> 00:03:21.095
I cannot believe what you're saying.

00:03:22.066 --> 00:03:23.192
Rushuna...

00:03:23.334 --> 00:03:26.599
Thank you, Teppa, but I'm okay.

00:03:28.038 --> 00:03:32.031
Please don't shoot.
I don't want to shoot you.

00:03:34.812 --> 00:03:37.440
Will you believe me now?

00:03:37.548 --> 00:03:38.674
Rushuna.

00:03:40.951 --> 00:03:47.356
We do not wish for you to
be our enemy either, so...

00:03:55.032 --> 00:03:55.964
Come.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:00.059
Tenshi will determine the
fate of our new arrivals.

00:04:03.407 --> 00:04:07.969
I'm not the scary woman
you all think I am.

00:04:16.754 --> 00:04:20.212
Rushuna, please be careful.

00:04:30.134 --> 00:04:36.334
Tenshi has retired for the day. You'll have
an audience with her tomorrow.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:42.177
This will be your room.

00:04:45.749 --> 00:04:47.774
Who are you?

00:04:48.018 --> 00:04:50.714
People call me Kaizan Doshi.

00:04:51.088 --> 00:04:53.249
Are you the Jester?

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:56.382
Forgive my repeated discourtesies.

00:04:56.527 --> 00:04:59.655
All is in accordance with Tenshi's ideals.

00:04:59.797 --> 00:05:00.991
Tenshi's?

00:05:01.131 --> 00:05:04.100
That will all become clear tomorrow.

00:05:04.235 --> 00:05:06.601
Please rest tonight.

00:05:14.078 --> 00:05:16.512
It's been sealed off.

00:05:16.647 --> 00:05:21.414
I guess they wouldn't leave
the passage open, would they?

00:05:21.552 --> 00:05:23.747
What should I do?

00:05:24.622 --> 00:05:28.422
Jeez, what am I going to do?

00:05:29.493 --> 00:05:32.826
There's no way I can go to sleep.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.527
Tenshi...

00:05:36.066 --> 00:05:39.502
Did Tenshi really change?

00:05:40.237 --> 00:05:42.034
If she did...

00:05:42.439 --> 00:05:44.873
No, there's no way...

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:49.975
There's someone
watching me, isn't there?

00:05:50.147 --> 00:05:53.913
You must be bored.
Won't you have a chat with me?

00:05:54.351 --> 00:05:56.842
You don't like talking?

00:06:01.258 --> 00:06:03.351
That smells like a bath.

00:06:07.031 --> 00:06:08.999
What a cute tub.

00:06:21.145 --> 00:06:24.012
I wonder if it got there okay.

00:06:30.187 --> 00:06:30.778
Huh?

00:06:40.197 --> 00:06:42.165
Where is this?

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:48.664
Is someone there?

00:06:49.473 --> 00:06:52.101
I don't need anything.

00:06:52.242 --> 00:06:56.975
It's going to get cold tonight.
You should go home and get warm.

00:06:57.982 --> 00:07:02.976
I am a swordsman named Yajiro Kojima.
I have a reason for passing through here.

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:06.419
A swordsman? You are not
someone from the Imperial Court?

00:07:06.557 --> 00:07:08.821
What are you doing here?

00:07:08.926 --> 00:07:09.915
What?

00:07:10.294 --> 00:07:14.890
I don't know. I've been
imprisoned here for months.

00:07:15.199 --> 00:07:16.063
Your name?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:20.569
I have not been called by my name
since ascending the throne.

00:07:20.671 --> 00:07:21.899
Are you Tenshi?

00:07:22.139 --> 00:07:25.336
It's you, you're Tenshi, aren't you?

00:07:26.644 --> 00:07:29.807
You have a very rough
manner of speaking.

00:07:29.947 --> 00:07:37.149
You... are you... you must
be Tenshi, Her Highness...

00:07:37.321 --> 00:07:39.789
You needn't try so hard.

00:07:40.624 --> 00:07:44.492
This is making me crazy.
It's like talking to Rushuna.

00:07:44.628 --> 00:07:45.925
Rushuna?

00:07:46.063 --> 00:07:48.429
Do you know Rushuna?

00:07:54.138 --> 00:07:57.005
You out there, won't you join me?

00:07:57.141 --> 00:07:59.837
I'll scrub your back for you.

00:08:01.679 --> 00:08:03.510
Any change?

00:08:03.914 --> 00:08:06.212
No, sir. Nothing at all.

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:08.752
Let me know if she makes any moves.

00:08:08.752 --> 00:08:10.219
<i>Yes, sir.
Let me know if she makes any moves.</i>

00:08:17.361 --> 00:08:19.659
Oops...

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:23.231
Um, excuse me.

00:08:33.844 --> 00:08:35.971
Damned Yajiro.

00:08:43.353 --> 00:08:46.880
Yajiro Kojima, I remember you.

00:08:47.191 --> 00:08:49.785
You are traveling with Rushuna.

00:08:49.893 --> 00:08:50.587
Yes.

00:08:50.794 --> 00:08:53.388
Have you come to kill me?

00:08:53.997 --> 00:08:54.793
No.

00:08:57.601 --> 00:09:01.059
I heard that you were one of the rebels.

00:09:01.405 --> 00:09:05.637
My thinking has changed while
traveling with Rushuna.

00:09:05.776 --> 00:09:08.006
I see.

00:09:08.278 --> 00:09:11.076
Then why are you here?

00:09:11.315 --> 00:09:16.082
You ordered the assassination of
Rushuna. I want to find out why.

00:09:16.253 --> 00:09:17.845
Assassination?

00:09:19.089 --> 00:09:22.081
I would never do such a thing.

00:09:22.359 --> 00:09:23.951
I thought so.

00:09:24.194 --> 00:09:26.321
It's his doing.

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:29.497
Him? You mean Kaizan Doshi?

00:09:32.536 --> 00:09:34.731
<i>Three Years ago</i>

00:09:35.239 --> 00:09:41.041
He appeared right after
I succeeded my father.

00:09:42.045 --> 00:09:44.206
A feudalistic plan?

00:09:44.348 --> 00:09:50.082
Yes, it is a secret plan the deceased
emperor and I have been working on.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:54.520
By placing a warlord in each territory,
we can gain control of one area at a time.

00:09:54.625 --> 00:09:59.221
I do not wish anything that
will cause blood to be shed.

00:09:59.429 --> 00:10:03.991
I understand your philosophy,
but that will take too long.

00:10:04.134 --> 00:10:08.628
There are rumors that rebels
in Tento are making plans.

00:10:08.939 --> 00:10:10.340
We have not a second to waste...

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.109
<i>Ideals take time to realize.
We have not a second to waste...</i>

00:10:12.109 --> 00:10:14.475
<i>Ideals take time to realize.</i>

00:10:19.049 --> 00:10:22.815
Rushuna and Touka...
And there are others too.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:28.048
More and more people were
understanding my thinking.

00:10:28.225 --> 00:10:32.218
And that was a problem for them,
so they locked you up here.

00:10:32.462 --> 00:10:34.430
I imagine so.

00:10:34.531 --> 00:10:36.226
Now I get it.

00:10:39.803 --> 00:10:41.930
Damned Yajiro.

00:10:45.742 --> 00:10:47.004
Wake up.

00:10:49.213 --> 00:10:52.182
What kind of dreams were you having?

00:10:52.316 --> 00:10:54.011
Please forgive me.

00:10:54.117 --> 00:10:58.213
I guess she didn't feel the need
to rifle through your clothes.

00:11:00.657 --> 00:11:03.387
I'm sorry! I'll go find her right away!

00:11:03.527 --> 00:11:07.258
That's not necessary.
I know where she is.

00:11:12.669 --> 00:11:14.864
It's been so long.

00:11:16.406 --> 00:11:19.034
Erase the enemy's will to fight.

00:11:19.142 --> 00:11:22.669
First, you need to smile.

00:11:22.946 --> 00:11:24.140
Smile?

00:11:24.781 --> 00:11:28.182
I still don't understand that very well.

00:11:28.719 --> 00:11:32.485
You just have to remember what it feels
like to see these beautiful flowers.

00:11:32.623 --> 00:11:36.616
If you remember the
fragrance of these flowers...

00:11:37.094 --> 00:11:40.063
...a smile will come
to your face, naturally.

00:11:42.299 --> 00:11:44.460
The ultimate fighting strategy...

00:11:44.568 --> 00:11:48.868
This is where she taught it to me.
It hasn't changed a bit.

00:11:49.239 --> 00:11:52.902
I'm sure Tenshi hasn't changed.

00:11:54.011 --> 00:11:56.775
Rushuna? Is that you, Rushuna?

00:12:00.617 --> 00:12:03.211
I've been waiting for you, Rushuna.

00:12:04.488 --> 00:12:05.682
Tenshi!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.362
Tenshi!

00:12:20.003 --> 00:12:21.231
Tenshi!

00:12:21.438 --> 00:12:25.534
Rushuna, you're back safely.

00:12:25.676 --> 00:12:26.506
Yes.

00:12:26.877 --> 00:12:30.244
You've been through many hardships.

00:12:31.448 --> 00:12:34.815
About the order to assassinate you...

00:12:35.819 --> 00:12:41.416
Please understand. Everything is part
of a plan to put these wars to an end.

00:12:41.558 --> 00:12:43.219
<i>Plan</i>

00:12:43.593 --> 00:12:46.221
The world is covered by dark clouds.

00:12:46.363 --> 00:12:49.628
I have come to realize
that the only way to...

00:12:49.766 --> 00:12:53.463
...dispel the darkness, is to
rely on those with strength.

00:12:53.704 --> 00:12:54.500
But...

00:12:54.771 --> 00:12:56.295
No, it's true.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:59.375
Of course, blood should not be shed.

00:12:59.476 --> 00:13:03.742
However, the people have been
waiting for a strong person.

00:13:03.847 --> 00:13:08.341
I had to prove to them
that this person existed.

00:13:08.485 --> 00:13:11.249
Rushuna, that's you.

00:13:11.421 --> 00:13:15.380
I sent you out into the darkness
and ordered your assassination.

00:13:15.492 --> 00:13:19.588
To spread the name of "the
Grenadier," it was essential.

00:13:20.764 --> 00:13:24.666
Then what about the
ultimate fighting strategy?

00:13:25.502 --> 00:13:30.201
After installing warlords in the
territories, and gaining control...

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:35.710
...we will exhibit our strength in a way
that will make even the warlords cower.

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:41.510
That is the ultimate fighting strategy
that will erase the enemy's will to fight.

00:13:41.651 --> 00:13:43.881
B-But...

00:13:46.256 --> 00:13:49.714
Oh, it's been so long.
This is my bedroom.

00:13:49.826 --> 00:13:52.317
Now isn't the time for this.

00:13:52.462 --> 00:13:52.951
Huh?

00:13:53.063 --> 00:13:55.759
I mean, uh... don't you agree?

00:13:55.932 --> 00:13:57.034
You don't need to try so hard.

00:13:57.034 --> 00:14:00.731
<i>Anyhow! We need to find Rushuna now.
You don't need to try so hard.</i>

00:14:00.837 --> 00:14:01.565
Yes.

00:14:06.243 --> 00:14:08.768
Forgive me, Tenshi...

00:14:09.546 --> 00:14:12.674
But through my travels, I've learned...

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.845
...that by being unarmored...

00:14:16.219 --> 00:14:17.948
...by smiling...

00:14:18.288 --> 00:14:21.849
...by holding your enemy to your bosom...

00:14:22.059 --> 00:14:26.052
...and sometimes, by stripping
your enemy of his armor...

00:14:26.797 --> 00:14:30.631
When you can achieve that,
your enemy understands.

00:14:30.734 --> 00:14:35.535
There were others who lived by
these teachings of yours as well.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.968
But you can do it without force.

00:14:40.243 --> 00:14:45.772
It may be one step at a time, one person
at a time, but it can change the world.

00:14:45.916 --> 00:14:49.511
So I'd like to continue doing it this way.

00:14:49.619 --> 00:14:52.179
Please, try to understand!

00:14:53.423 --> 00:14:54.724
Is that so?

00:14:54.724 --> 00:14:55.452
<i>Yes.
Is that so?</i>

00:14:55.759 --> 00:15:00.253
And that's why I cannot
accept the title of "Grenadier."

00:15:00.397 --> 00:15:03.423
Even though it's a title I've given you?

00:15:05.635 --> 00:15:06.431
Yes.

00:15:06.837 --> 00:15:09.032
Why are you so insistent?

00:15:09.139 --> 00:15:12.939
Because you're not Tenshi.

00:15:13.276 --> 00:15:15.039
What are you saying?

00:15:15.145 --> 00:15:18.114
You are Tenshi's double.

00:15:18.281 --> 00:15:19.407
<i>Setsuna Onmidoh</i>

00:15:19.549 --> 00:15:22.450
You are Ms. Setsuna Onmidoh.

00:15:23.687 --> 00:15:27.987
I thought my act was perfect.
How did you know?

00:15:28.125 --> 00:15:31.856
No matter how much her thinking
may change, Tenshi would...

00:15:31.962 --> 00:15:34.692
...never break off a tree branch.

00:15:34.931 --> 00:15:39.197
You know since you went through
the same training as I did...

00:15:39.369 --> 00:15:42.770
...that it takes a long time
to become Tenshi's decoy bodyguard.

00:15:42.906 --> 00:15:46.740
I changed my appearance and
learned how to speak like her.

00:15:46.843 --> 00:15:48.777
But a single branch...

00:15:48.979 --> 00:15:50.776
I'm sorry about that.

00:15:50.881 --> 00:15:51.870
Fool!

00:15:52.015 --> 00:15:56.577
You are but one person rising up
against us! What can you accomplish?

00:15:56.987 --> 00:15:59.080
Someone! Is anyone there?

00:15:59.489 --> 00:16:03.448
Rushuna Tendo has
threatened me! Shoot her!

00:16:03.593 --> 00:16:06.619
Stop right there, Rushuna Tendo!

00:16:06.796 --> 00:16:10.232
You insolent woman,
attempting to take Tenshi's life!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.630
Wait a second, there's been a mistake!

00:16:12.736 --> 00:16:14.397
Shoot her!

00:16:15.739 --> 00:16:17.730
What are you doing, shoot her!

00:16:17.807 --> 00:16:19.069
She's unarmed!

00:16:19.209 --> 00:16:23.805
That's her strategy. You have no idea
what she may be hiding in her bosom!

00:16:23.947 --> 00:16:25.346
Shoot her!

00:16:26.249 --> 00:16:30.413
Even if they are skilled marksmen,
it will be easy to dodge their bullets.

00:16:30.554 --> 00:16:34.354
No matter how many bullets there are,
there is only one target.

00:16:38.195 --> 00:16:40.356
I can't wait anymore.

00:16:40.497 --> 00:16:42.727
I'm going to go ahead!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:44.826
Here they are!

00:16:45.835 --> 00:16:47.063
It's begun!

00:16:47.237 --> 00:16:48.101
Rushuna!

00:16:48.238 --> 00:16:49.102
Hurry.

00:16:54.377 --> 00:16:57.039
There are too many of them.

00:16:57.581 --> 00:16:58.912
What should I do?

00:17:02.719 --> 00:17:04.050
The peach tree!

00:17:09.092 --> 00:17:10.081
Teppa!

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:13.194
Rushuna, hold on to this.

00:17:15.065 --> 00:17:18.557
Teppa, she's not Tenshi.
She's an imposter.

00:17:19.169 --> 00:17:19.999
Got it!

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:26.698
Damn you, Teppa Aizen! After him!

00:17:31.281 --> 00:17:32.976
Where is her revolver?

00:17:33.083 --> 00:17:34.141
Here, sir.

00:17:34.384 --> 00:17:36.409
<i>Don't let go of it!
Yes, sir.</i>

00:17:37.754 --> 00:17:39.722
Hold on, Rushuna!

00:17:43.293 --> 00:17:44.817
I'll take this!

00:17:45.895 --> 00:17:47.328
Damn!

00:17:51.768 --> 00:17:53.861
Please stop running.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.461
I don't want to fight you.

00:17:57.374 --> 00:17:59.342
Please tell me...

00:17:59.476 --> 00:18:01.467
Where is the real Tenshi?

00:18:01.578 --> 00:18:02.875
It's over.

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:11.042
I guess there's no need
to tell you anymore.

00:18:11.154 --> 00:18:14.146
Tento is already mine.

00:18:14.357 --> 00:18:16.416
I will win this!

00:18:19.429 --> 00:18:21.829
Huh? Wait! What is that?

00:18:22.265 --> 00:18:25.428
Don't be fooled! That's her strategy.

00:18:25.602 --> 00:18:27.126
But... look!

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.464
Something's coming.

00:18:32.609 --> 00:18:33.803
It's a missile!

00:18:33.943 --> 00:18:34.932
Look closely!

00:18:35.111 --> 00:18:36.976
Someone is on it!

00:18:38.315 --> 00:18:39.805
No!

00:18:47.357 --> 00:18:48.722
You...

00:18:49.259 --> 00:18:51.159
Touka Kurenai.

00:18:52.562 --> 00:18:53.654
Ms. Touka!

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.661
Surprised, Rushuna?

00:18:55.765 --> 00:18:56.390
Yes!

00:18:56.566 --> 00:18:59.558
I got here without
losing my breath.

00:18:59.669 --> 00:19:02.194
Banmaru made it for you?

00:19:02.339 --> 00:19:04.000
That's right.

00:19:04.374 --> 00:19:06.205
Touka Kurenai...

00:19:06.343 --> 00:19:09.574
This woman is the enemy, Rushuna
Tendo!

00:19:10.213 --> 00:19:12.841
Tenshi is mistaken.

00:19:13.216 --> 00:19:15.810
Rushuna's enemy is my enemy.

00:19:16.052 --> 00:19:18.020
She's Ms. Setsuna.

00:19:18.154 --> 00:19:19.121
I see.

00:19:19.622 --> 00:19:24.525
We have another person who has
betrayed Tenshi. Show no mercy!

00:19:25.662 --> 00:19:27.186
Listen!

00:19:28.665 --> 00:19:35.833
This man imprisoned Tenshi and this
woman has disguised herself as Tenshi.

00:19:39.209 --> 00:19:40.767
Silence!

00:19:42.145 --> 00:19:46.605
Watch out for that weapon.
I've been on the receiving end of it.

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:47.978
Rushuna!

00:19:48.551 --> 00:19:49.779
Take this!

00:19:49.953 --> 00:19:51.648
Damn you!

00:19:58.428 --> 00:20:02.421
I have such wonderful friends.

00:20:02.565 --> 00:20:03.793
Fools!

00:20:04.667 --> 00:20:09.661
Is it your plan to defeat us and lead Tento
...no, the world... into a state of chaos?

00:20:09.906 --> 00:20:14.969
I believe that with the teachings
Tenshi has passed on to me...

00:20:15.111 --> 00:20:18.478
...the fighting can be brought to an end.

00:20:18.681 --> 00:20:20.672
Where is the real Tenshi?

00:20:22.018 --> 00:20:24.009
Do you think she's alive?

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:25.018
What?

00:20:25.555 --> 00:20:27.420
She's alive!

00:20:27.991 --> 00:20:28.821
Yatchan!

00:20:29.025 --> 00:20:30.287
Tenshi!

00:20:33.763 --> 00:20:34.923
Everyone!

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.032
Kasumi!

00:20:38.134 --> 00:20:39.863
Get back, Yajiro.

00:20:44.274 --> 00:20:45.241
Tenshi!

00:20:45.408 --> 00:20:47.740
Don't move.

00:20:48.378 --> 00:20:52.781
One look away, and no one will
be able to tell the difference.

00:20:52.916 --> 00:20:56.044
Let's do this again. Let's go.

00:20:57.253 --> 00:21:00.222
Setsuna, why are you doing this?

00:21:00.323 --> 00:21:01.984
Silence! Come!

00:21:02.992 --> 00:21:06.018
You should always save
one trick up your sleeve.

00:21:06.296 --> 00:21:07.854
You dirty bastard.

00:21:07.997 --> 00:21:11.228
It's all to gain power
over Tento, no... the world!

00:21:11.367 --> 00:21:15.997
This was once your dream too.
Join me again, Yajiro!

00:21:16.139 --> 00:21:20.940
I'll take your words as a
farewell gift and go to my death.

00:21:21.411 --> 00:21:23.470
You stupid fool!

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.942
Goodbye!

00:21:28.985 --> 00:21:32.785
I can't believe I'm protecting
such an ugly person.

00:21:33.256 --> 00:21:34.780
Bastard!

00:21:36.292 --> 00:21:38.351
Thanks, Teppa.

00:21:40.196 --> 00:21:42.892
Rushuna, I'll deal with this. You go.

00:21:42.999 --> 00:21:43.863
Okay!

00:21:44.367 --> 00:21:47.734
So boys, are you going to attack me?

00:21:48.571 --> 00:21:51.904
I'll take you on whenever you like.

00:21:54.577 --> 00:21:55.509
Yatchan!

00:21:55.645 --> 00:21:56.339
Yo!

00:21:56.513 --> 00:21:59.778
I will rescue Tenshi, no matter what!

00:21:59.916 --> 00:22:01.110
Kaizan Doshi!

00:22:01.251 --> 00:22:04.709
I promise I will...
I will strip him of his armor!

00:22:04.821 --> 00:22:05.685
Yes!

00:22:14.964 --> 00:22:24.600
<i>All alone,
so many nights I want to cry.</i>

00:22:25.675 --> 00:22:35.346
<i>Everyone dreams on
the road of the endless journey.</i>

00:22:36.653 --> 00:22:41.886
<i>Always believe in something,
and always lose something.</i>

00:22:42.058 --> 00:22:46.119
<i>I hold you.</i>

00:22:47.196 --> 00:22:54.932
<i>All the tears I shed
will turn into kindness.</i>

00:22:55.271 --> 00:22:57.364
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:02.771
<i>Don't be defeated by sadness.</i>

00:23:02.979 --> 00:23:08.417
<i>Keep your eye on tomorrow.</i>

00:23:08.618 --> 00:23:18.619
<i>You're not alone.
Everyone has dreams to come true.</i>

00:23:18.962 --> 00:23:29.770
<i>The winds of tomorrow will bring
the fragrance of kindness.</i>

00:23:29.939 --> 00:23:40.543
<i>It's a promise...
I'll always be by your side.</i>

00:23:42.719 --> 00:23:44.687
<i>Next Episode</i>

00:23:45.021 --> 00:23:48.684
Tenshi... Teppa saved me.

00:23:48.825 --> 00:23:54.730
Ms. Touka shares the same ideas we do
and I think Mikan understands now, too.

00:23:54.864 --> 00:23:59.028
And even Yatchan, who
was so set against you...

00:23:59.202 --> 00:24:02.262
People are changing,
though it may be one by one...

00:24:02.405 --> 00:24:04.396
...they have smiles on their faces.

00:24:04.507 --> 00:24:09.274
Next episode of "Grenadier,"
Things Learned on the Road.

00:24:09.412 --> 00:24:11.937
Would you like to join me?
